<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>DotNetDupe</id>
    <version>5.0.5</version>
    <authors>Sudheesh Subramanian</authors>
    <description>A modern, cross-platform C++ Base Class Library (BCL) bringing the elegance, productivity, and familiar APIs of .NET to C++.</description>
    <releaseNotes>v5.0.5 (Latest)
- Zero-Re-Stat File Metadata &amp; Atomic Verified Copy (System::IO::FileInfo, FileSystemEntry, File, Directory):
  * Added FileSystemEntry and Directory::GetFileSystemEntriesWithMetadata() to harvest 64-bit file size, creation/modification timestamps, attributes, and symlink/reparse-point flags in a single OS traversal pass without secondary stat calls.
  * Added FileInfo for object-oriented file metadata inspection (GetLength64, GetCreationTime, GetLastWriteTime, GetExtension, GetDirectoryName, GetIsReparsePoint, CopyTo, MoveTo, Delete).
  * Extended File with GetLength, GetCreationTime, GetLastWriteTime, SetLastWriteTime, ReadAllBytes, WriteAllBytes, AreFilesByteIdentical, timestamp-preserving Copy, and atomic CopyVerified (staging .part copy + read-back SHA-256 verification).
  * Added two-argument Path::Combine(sPath1, sPath2) overload.
- Partial &amp; Fast Edge SHA-256 Hashing (System::Security::Cryptography::SHA256):
  * Added SHA256::HashData(pStream, llOffset, llCount) for bounded stream slice hashing.
  * Added SHA256::ComputeFastEdgeHash(sFilePath, iEdgeBytes) and SHA256::HashFileToHex(sFilePath) for high-speed multi-stage duplicate elimination.
- Cross-Platform Image Decoding &amp; EXIF Extraction (System::Drawing::Imaging):
  * Added RawImage for 32-bit ARGB pixel buffer management, cropping (Crop), bilinear scaling (ResizeBilinear), normalized RGB float tensor conversion (ToNormalizedRgbTensor), and BMP loading/saving.
  * Added ExifMetadata for extracting image dimensions, orientation, capture timestamps (DateTimeOriginal), and camera make/model from JPEG APP1 EXIF, PNG IHDR, and BMP headers.
- Local ML Face Recognition &amp; Vector Mathematics (System::AI):
  * Added VectorMath (DotProduct, Magnitude, L2Normalize, CosineSimilarity, EuclideanDistance).
  * Added FaceRecognitionEngine, DetectedFace, and IFaceRecognitionBackend for local face detection, 128-D L2-normalized embedding extraction, and identity matching (ComputeSimilarity, IsSamePerson).

v5.0.4
- Added System::IO::DriveInfo with drive metrics, volume labels, and free space telemetry (GetDrives, GetTotalSize, GetTotalFreeSpace, GetAvailableFreeSpace).
- Added SearchOption enumeration and recursive search overloads to System::IO::Directory.
- Upgraded System::IO::Stream and FileStream with 64-bit positioning (GetLength64, GetPosition64, SetPosition64, Seek64).
- Added System::Security::Cryptography::SHA256 streaming hash algorithm with FIPS 180-2 compliance.
- Added Task::WaitAll batch synchronization in System::Threading::Tasks.

v5.0.3
- Bundled OpenSSL 4.0.1 native dependencies for Linux (libssl.so.4, libcrypto.so.4) and Windows (libssl-4-x64.dll, libcrypto-4-x64.dll).
- Included pre-built Linux native shared library (runtimes/linux-x64/native/libDotNetDupe.so) with automatic -lssl -lcrypto linking and staging in DotNetDupe.targets.
- Added System::Math and System::Numerics::Statistics with standard IEEE 754 arithmetic and financial time-series moving window indicators.
- Enhanced System::Text::Json::JsonSerializer and JsonElement with strongly-typed generic DTO serialization/deserialization and property accessors.

v5.0.2
- Retrofitted ConcurrentQueue, ConcurrentStack, ConcurrentBag, BlockingCollection, and ConcurrentDictionary to inherit generic collection interfaces (IReadOnlyCollection, IEnumerable, IDictionary) and introduced IProducerConsumerCollection.
- Added lock-free snapshot enumeration and direct LINQ method chaining on concurrent collections.

v5.0.1
- Documentation updates, dedicated LINQ guide with practical examples, and updated Table of Contents in README.

v5.0.0
- Major version release introducing System::Linq query operators with zero-STL allocation algorithms, range-for loop support, and full Linux/Windows parity.</releaseNotes>
    <readme>README.md</readme>
    <projectUrl>https://sudheeshps.github.io/dotnetdupe/</projectUrl>
    <repository type="git" url="https://github.com/sudheeshps/dotnetdupe" branch="main" />
    <license type="expression">MIT</license>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <tags>native c++ dotnet multi-platform linux windows bcl linq io sha256 imaging ai</tags>
    <dependencies>
    </dependencies>
    <contentFiles>
    </contentFiles>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="obj\README.nuget.md" target="README.md" />
    <file src="LICENSE" target="LICENSE" />
    <file src="external\openssl-4.0.1\LICENSE.txt" target="licenses\OPENSSL_LICENSE.txt" />
    <file src="external\openssl-4.0.1\version.txt" target="OPENSSL_VERSION.txt" />
    <!-- Build targets & Debugger Visualizers -->
    <file src="nuget\DotNetDupe.targets" target="build\native\DotNetDupe.targets" />
    <file src="DotNetDupe.natvis" target="build\native\DotNetDupe.natvis" />

    <!-- Headers -->
    <file src="Include\**\*.h" target="include" />

    <!-- Documentation -->
    <file src="docs\*.md" target="docs" />

    <!-- Multi-platform Binaries -->
    <!-- Windows x64 -->
    <file src="bin\x64\Release\DotNetDupe.dll" target="runtimes\win-x64\native\DotNetDupe.dll" />
    <file src="bin\x64\Release\DotNetDupe.lib" target="runtimes\win-x64\native\DotNetDupe.lib" />
    <file src="bin\x64\Release\DotNetDupe.pdb" target="runtimes\win-x64\native\DotNetDupe.pdb" />
    <file src="external\openssl-4.0.1\x64\bin\libssl-4-x64.dll" target="runtimes\win-x64\native\libssl-4-x64.dll" />
    <file src="external\openssl-4.0.1\x64\bin\libcrypto-4-x64.dll" target="runtimes\win-x64\native\libcrypto-4-x64.dll" />
    
    <!-- Windows x86 -->
    <file src="external\openssl-4.0.1\x86\bin\libssl-4.dll" target="runtimes\win-x86\native\libssl-4.dll" />
    <file src="external\openssl-4.0.1\x86\bin\libcrypto-4.dll" target="runtimes\win-x86\native\libcrypto-4.dll" />

    <!-- Linux x64 -->
    <file src="build-wsl\libDotNetDupe.so" target="runtimes\linux-x64\native\libDotNetDupe.so" />
    <file src="external\openssl-4.0.1\linux-x64\lib\libssl.so.4" target="runtimes\linux-x64\native\libssl.so.4" />
    <file src="external\openssl-4.0.1\linux-x64\lib\libssl.so" target="runtimes\linux-x64\native\libssl.so" />
    <file src="external\openssl-4.0.1\linux-x64\lib\libcrypto.so.4" target="runtimes\linux-x64\native\libcrypto.so.4" />
    <file src="external\openssl-4.0.1\linux-x64\lib\libcrypto.so" target="runtimes\linux-x64\native\libcrypto.so" />
  </files>
</package>
